<title>UK: Rheinhyp to launch dollar denominated Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>Rheinhyp to launch dollar denominated Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>RHEINHYP Rheinische Hypothekenbank AG will launch the first dollar denominated global Pfandbrief, joint lead manager Commerzbank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Morgan Stanley is the other lead manager.  </p>
<p>Rheinhyp aims to expand the investor base for Pfandbrief securities, the statement said. There will be a series of roadshows in Asia, Europe and the U.S. after which the terms will be decided. Pfandbriefe are bonds issued by German mortgage banks. --  London Newsroom  +44 171 542 7970</p>
</text>
